OncoPattern
Cancer pattern analysis, simulation, visualisation and reporting,
written entirely in .tech on the TECH self-hosting toolchain.

Author      K-S (Kanishk-Soni)
Company     ESS KS Life Tech
Repository  https://github.com/esskslifetech/OncoPattern_Via_TECH
Toolchain   https://github.com/esskslifetech/TECH

External data sources used at run time, with thanks:
  European Patent Office — Linked Open Data SPARQL endpoint
                           https://data.epo.org/linked-data/query
  Europe PMC (EMBL-EBI)  — REST search over PubMed/MEDLINE and PMC
                           https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/
